---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact — Thriai" description="Book a 30-minute call with Thriai. Tell us about your company, your stage, and what is broken. We will tell you whether the fit is real and what it would cost.">
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:40px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
      <h1>Thirty minutes. Fit first, price second.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Email works best. Tell us your company, stage, revenue range, what your finance stack looks like today, and what prompted the search. You will hear back within one business day with a yes, a no, or the two questions we need answered to decide.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid c2">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Email</h3>
          <p><a href="mailto:hello@thriai.io?subject=Intro%20call%20with%20Thriai" style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">hello@thriai.io</a></p>
          <p class="muted">Include a link to your company and a sentence on what is broken. Attachments are fine.</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:hello@thriai.io?subject=Intro%20call%20with%20Thriai&body=Company%3A%0AStage%20and%20revenue%20range%3A%0ACurrent%20finance%20stack%3A%0AWhat%20prompted%20this%3A%0A">Start the email</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>What happens next</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>A 30-minute call, usually within the week</li>
            <li>A written scope and a single fixed number inside the published range</li>
            <li>A master services agreement and a statement of work, month to month, thirty days notice</li>
            <li>Onboarding into your own platform repo, measured in days</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="notice" style="margin-top:18px">We work with technology companies from first revenue to about $100M, and with PE sponsors on portfolio programs. If that is not you, we will say so quickly and point you somewhere useful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
